{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54703","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 四十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 四十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太阳畔，两手在其傍。\n更有金星圆出现，后妃作孽乱生狂，乾地（京本作「帝」）应其殃。\n（乾符六年二月十八日午时现。\n京本「乾符」前有「唐禧宗」三字。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54703.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54703","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}